Z||000000||fiero56||08-26-2000||01:13 AM||||Figure its been a while since these have been talked about, and figure we have many new members here who  have not heard of these.<P>There is a man in Galion, OH named Mark Corbin, who produces "The Fiero Spotters Guide." This is an 80 page booklet filled with production numbers, VIN decoding, models, options, colors, RPO codes, production numbers, option numbers, etc, etc, etc...<P>The best part is this 80 page booklet is only $5($4 for the book, $1 shipping). I have ordered one from him, received my book, and now it lives in my Fiero so I have it whenever I need it.<P>To anyone interested in these must have books, send a check made payable to Mark Corbin", and send it to:<P>Fiero Spotters Guide<BR>5474 S.R. 19<BR>Galion, OH 44833<P>There are many members here with these books who will also give praise for these books and for Mark.<P>I am not Mark, nor do I get anything for posting this, just figure it will help answer many questions people have about these cars.||||reg||10
